Chrontel CH7036 Code
--------------------

Code from Chrontel:

GenTableCH7036.c	Routines to generate and return register settings
GenTableCH7036.h	Header for above
License.txt		Chrontel license
build.sh		Example compiler line
fw7036.bin		Binary firmware to load into CH7036
postgen7036.c		Example backend code
tbl365.c		Example code for using GenTableCH7036


